---
Use this model for the assistant's next message, in every conversation

Usage: mxr assistant model set [OPTIONS] <MODEL>

Arguments:
  <MODEL>  A model id from `mxr assistant model`, such as claude-haiku-5-5

Options:
      --dry-run          Check the choice and show what would change, without changing it
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
